      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: The user would need to create a custom Base layer or change the animation since the one provide in the SDK will bend the toe when entering the crouching blend tree. No matter the platform, FBT/VR/Desktop, they all share the same blend tree at the moment.\nWork around is to change the crouching idle with the standing idle as 2.0 do.\nMaybe in the future they should rework the Base layer provided within the SDK with different blend tree for each tracking type.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
